{0 Scrollycode Demos}

{%html:
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300..900;1,9..144,300..900&family=Source+Code+Pro:ital,wght@0,300..900;1,300..900&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,300..900;1,8..60,300..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
.odoc-nav, .odoc-tocs, .odoc-search { display: none !important; }
.odoc-preamble > h1 { display: none !important; }
.odoc-preamble, .odoc-content { max-width: none !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; }
body.odoc, .odoc { padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; max-width: none !important; }

.demos-index {
  font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
  background: #f4f0e8;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.demos-header {
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 6rem 2rem 3rem;
  text-align: center;
}

.demos-header h1 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: #2c2416;
}

.demos-header h1 em {
  font-style: italic;
  color: #c25832;
}

.demos-header p {
  color: #6b5d4d;
  max-width: 50ch;
  margin: 0 auto;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.demos-list {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 1rem 2rem 6rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.25rem;
}

.demo-card {
  display: block;
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid rgba(44,36,22,0.08);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
}

.demo-card:hover {
  border-color: #c25832;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(194,88,50,0.1);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.demo-card-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.demo-card-number {
  font-family: 'Source Code Pro', monospace;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: #c25832;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.demo-card h2 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  margin: 0;
}

.demo-card p {
  color: #6b5d4d;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0.5rem 0;
}

.demo-card .tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
}

.tag {
  font-family: 'Source Code Pro', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  padding: 0.2em 0.6em;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: rgba(194,88,50,0.07);
  color: #c25832;
}

.tag.dark {
  background: #1a1a2e;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
}

.demos-footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 0 2rem 4rem;
  font-family: 'Source Code Pro', monospace;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: #6b5d4d;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.demos-footer a {
  color: #c25832;
  text-decoration: none;
}
</style>

<div class="demos-index">

<div class="demos-header">
  <h1>Scrollycoding in <em>OCaml</em></h1>
  <p>Three odoc extension plugins, each rendering the same scrollycode pattern with a radically different visual theme. Authored as <code>.mld</code> files using <code>@scrolly.&lt;theme&gt;</code> custom tags.</p>
</div>

<div class="demos-list">

  <a class="demo-card" href="warm_parser.html">
    <div class="demo-card-header">
      <span class="demo-card-number">01</span>
      <h2>The Warm Workshop</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Building a JSON parser step by step. Warm cream background with a dark navy code panel, Fraunces serif display type, and earthy burnt-sienna accents. Classic scrollycode split layout.</p>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">@scrolly.warm</span>
      <span class="tag">Fraunces + Source Serif</span>
      <span class="tag">parser tutorial</span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a class="demo-card" href="dark_repl.html">
    <div class="demo-card-header">
      <span class="demo-card-number">02</span>
      <h2>The Dark Terminal</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Building a REPL from scratch. Near-black cinematic theme with phosphor-green accents, JetBrains Mono code font, and the code panel as the visual hero. Prose in a narrow left column.</p>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag dark">@scrolly.dark</span>
      <span class="tag">JetBrains Mono + Outfit</span>
      <span class="tag">REPL tutorial</span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a class="demo-card" href="notebook_testing.html">
    <div class="demo-card-header">
      <span class="demo-card-number">03</span>
      <h2>The Notebook</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Building a test framework incrementally. Clean editorial aesthetic with a soft white background, blue-violet accents, Newsreader serif headings, and generous whitespace.</p>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">@scrolly.notebook</span>
      <span class="tag">Newsreader + DM Sans</span>
      <span class="tag">testing tutorial</span>
    </div>
  </a>

</div>

<div class="demos-footer">
  Powered by <a href="https://ocaml.github.io/odoc/">odoc</a> custom tag extensions &middot; Inspired by <a href="https://codehike.org">Code Hike</a>
</div>

</div>
%}
